SUMMARY:Lancaster Breakfast and History Walking Tour
DESCRIPTION:Searching for a walking history tour in Lancaster? You’re in 
 for a flavorful experience—literally! Introducing the Lancaster History 
 & Breakfast Walking Tour—a dynamic two-hour adventure that blends the ri
 ch heritage of one of America’s oldest inland cities with a delicious mo
 rning meal. Explore Lancaster’s vibrant streets with a professionally tr
 ained local guide and journey through time from the early 1700s through th
 e transformative decades of the 20th century. Brought to you by Unique Lan
 caster Experiences\, this guided walk kicks off with your choice of hot or
  iced coffee or tea to energize your morning. Along the way\, you’ll hea
 r engaging stories about Lancaster’s evolution as a bustling Market City
  and its transition from trolleys to automobiles after WWI. But this isn
 ’t your standard history tour. You’ll dive into interactive discussion
 s and uncover captivating insights about colonial life\, architectural lan
 dmarks\, and the impact of prohibition on the region. As you explore\, you
 ’ll stop at five handpicked local spots to enjoy a curated tasting menu 
 featuring hearty breakfast sandwiches\, fresh fruits\, sweet pastries\, an
 d other morning favorites. Please note: This tour offers vegetarian-friend
 ly options only. If you have other dietary needs\, we recommend our Intern
 ational Food Tour for a better fit. Whether you’re passionate about hist
 ory\, love discovering new flavors\, or just want a memorable way to see t
 he city\, the Lancaster History & Breakfast Tour is a great choice for sol
 o explorers\, couples\, and groups alike.\n\nPrice: Not supplied by this c
 alendar\; check event details\n\nSchedule listed: Fri\, Dec 25\, 2026 09:0
 0 AM EST – Fri\, Dec 25\, 2026 11:00 AM EST\n\nSchedule supplied by Lanc
 asterPA\n\nTimes converted from America/New_York to UTC for calendar compa
 tibility.\n\n\n\nRegistration: https://lancasterpa.com/events-calendar/lan
 caster-breakfast-and-history-walking-tour/2026-12-25/\n\nAdding this calen
 dar item does not register you. Check the original listing for changes\; i
